"""Pry Sports Props Engine - generated by the Actor Factory.

PPE runtime: charges 'props-pulled' per processed URL via push_data, respects
user spending limits (event_charge_limit_reached), and flushes completed work
on platform abort. See ACTOR-FACTORY.md for methodology.

For each input URL (ESPN / odds API endpoint) the actor builds one
player-prop intelligence item per player/event: live props across books with
line movement, lineup/injury context, recent player stats with hot/cold
streaks, and defensive matchup context.
"""

